{"id":214836983482552,"type":"album","name":"Ray of Light","artist":"Madonna","year":1998,"weight":58,"info":{"cover":"https://dn710603.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-08dcbc7b-2cd6-3155-bd02-631124dfa493/mbid-08dcbc7b-2cd6-3155-bd02-631124dfa493-7049214901.jpg","kind":"Single","tracks":3,"country":"DE","aoty":77,"aoty_user":89,"yt":"QwSnUu9yCNs","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/madonna/ray-of-light","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/8441-madonna-ray-of-light.php"},"desc":"Ray of Light is the seventh studio album by Madonna, released on February 22, 1998 by Maverick Records. The album is a pop and dance record, yet, it contains elements of electronic music within its composition, making it a departure from her previous work. Additionally, it incorporates several genres and subgenres, including techno and ambient. The album has several themes, including spirituality. After giving birth to her daughter Lourdes, Madonna collaborated with Patrick Leonard and William Orbit in developing the album. After failed sessions with other producers, Madonna pursued a new musical direction with Orbit and incorporated his extensive usage ."},"artist_ref":{"id":120396521633899,"name":"Madonna","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Madonna_Rebel_Heart_Tour_2015_-_Stockholm_%2823051472299%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":140333798282585,"type":"genre","name":"House","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":538,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":202159817309393,"type":"genre","name":"blues","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":444,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":242119982771334,"type":"genre","name":"Electro","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":345,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":223122507869858,"type":"genre","name":"Dance-Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":311,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":56177319906220,"type":"genre","name":"electronica","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":262,"yt":n